window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>All is not well in the small town of Ashley Oaks, Texas, as the human inhabitants struggle to survive behind the walls of their makeshift fort. A zombie herd is on the outskirts of the town, and the survivors huddle behind the cement walls encompassing their encampment, in hopes that the undead will pass them by.</p> <p>While Katie is on sentry duty, a child cries out in the night, spurring Jenni into action. Soon, both women find themselves fighting against the ravenous undead in a seemingly futile attempt to save other survivors.</p> <p><b><i>Deadly Night</i></b><b> is an original As the World Dies story that takes place between </b><b><i>The First Days</i></b><b> and </b><b><i>Fighting to Survive</i></b><b>.</b></p>"; 
